# 🎯 STRATEGY — CAW Crystallize

> **Authority**: caw:/minispace/.know/canon/LIFECYCLE.ail + PRINCIPLES.ail
> **Branch**: `go:/olym/k/cogninfer/strategies/`
> **RRP**: `t:/gopia/olym/k/cogninfer/strategies/caw-crystallize.ail`

---

## S-CC-1 — Lifecycle 7 bước

```text
artifact
   ↓
1. IMPORT          (read-only source từ ha:/engine/, gh:cosda-dev, crates.io)
   ↓
2. ASSEMBLE        (path-deps trong ws-*/Cargo.toml)
   ↓
3. RESOLVE DEPS    (cargo metadata + cargo update)
   ↓
4. CARGO CHECK     (cargo check --release)
   ↓
5. CARGO TEST      (cargo test --release — smoke only)
   ↓
6. CRYSTALLIZE     (cargo build --release → strip → sign → pack)
   ↓
7. OUTPUTS         (.wasm .dll .so .a .cap .amo .ae .exe .rco .aso)
```

## S-CC-2 — Per-workspace Structure

```text
ws-<name>/
├── Cargo.toml                 # path-deps only — NO src/, NO crates/
├── manifest.ail               # workspace manifest
├── scripts/
│   ├── cargo-check.ps1
│   ├── cargo-test.ps1
│   ├── cargo-build.ps1
│   ├── cargo-crystallize.ps1
│   └── cargo-release.ps1
├── tests/                     # integration smoke tests
├── release/                   # crystallized outputs (generated)
└── README.md
```

## S-CC-3 — Cargo.toml canonical

```toml
# ws-<name>/Cargo.toml
[package]
name = "<workspace>"
version = "0.1.0"
edition = "2021"

[dependencies]
# Path-deps ONLY — read-only source từ Forge Layer
hace-actor-text = { path = "ha:/engine/hace/actor/text-ractor" }
hace-io-rac     = { path = "ha:/engine/hace/io/rac" }
serde = "1"

[profile.release]
opt-level = 3
lto = true
codegen-units = 1
strip = "symbols"
```

## S-CC-4 — Scripts chuẩn

```powershell
# scripts/cargo-check.ps1
Set-Location $PSScriptRoot/..
cargo check --release --target-dir caw:/minispace/.shared-target

# scripts/cargo-test.ps1
Set-Location $PSScriptRoot/..
cargo test --release --target-dir caw:/minispace/.shared-target

# scripts/cargo-crystallize.ps1
Set-Location $PSScriptRoot/..
cargo build --release --target-dir caw:/minispace/.shared-target
# → strip → sign (RNA Ed25519) → pack

# scripts/cargo-release.ps1
Set-Location $PSScriptRoot/..
# copy từ .shared-target/release/ sang ws-<name>/release/
Copy-Item caw:/minispace/.shared-target/release/<name>.<ext> release/
```

## S-CC-5 — Crystallize Output

```yaml
output_artifacts:
  location: "caw:/minispace/ws-<name>/release/"
  files:
    - "<name>.wasm"
    - "<name>.dll" | "<name>.so" | "<name>.dylib"
    - "<name>.cap"
    - "<name>.amo"
    - "<name>.ae"
    - "<name>.exe"  # optional
    - "<name>.rco"
    - "<name>.aso"
  signing:
    algorithm: "Ed25519"
    keypair: "t:/keys/<key_id>"
    manifest: "release/<name>.manifest.json"
```

## S-CC-6 — Fail handling

Nếu `cargo check` hoặc `cargo test` fail:

```text
caw FAIL
   ↓
DIAGNOSE (Fixer tại caw:/minispace/ws-<name>/)
   ↓
REPORT (Fixer ghi report)
   ↓
HANDOFF (Fixer chuyển về ha:/engine/<dom>/<mod>/)
   ↓
FORGE PATCH (Producer/Fixer tại ha:/)
   ↓
VALIDATE (Tester)
   ↓
PUSH (Publisher → gh:cosda-dev/*)
   ↓
RE-RUN caw:/minispace/ws-<name>/
```

